{"3739780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PROJECTA", "steam_appid": 3739780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras/71f0c04877c518bf354c72bb776a713c.poster.avif?t=1779993409\" width=750 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras/71f0c04877c518bf354c72bb776a713c.webm?t=1779993409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras/71f0c04877c518bf354c72bb776a713c.mp4?t=1779993409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧠 <strong>PROJECTA – Step Into the Rift Between Realities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>PROJECTA</i>, a co-op narrative-driven puzzle-action adventure that thrusts you and your alternate self into a collapsing multiverse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where parallel timelines are fraying, you and your variant must collaborate to restore stability — or risk becoming echoes of forgotten possibilities. Swap realities, manipulate time, and solve mind-bending spatial challenges as you traverse an ever-shifting world shaped by your choices and your coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras/16fa61f8d1fcc50d5f68d12156f82df3.poster.avif?t=1779993409\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras/16fa61f8d1fcc50d5f68d12156f82df3.webm?t=1779993409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras/16fa61f8d1fcc50d5f68d12156f82df3.mp4?t=1779993409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌌 Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 <strong>Doppelgänger Co-Op Gameplay</strong> – Control or cooperate with your alternate self across split timelines. Work together, or reverse time to undo critical mistakes.<br>🔹 <strong>Reality-Shifting Puzzles</strong> – Navigate rooms that change form between timelines. Solve puzzles that demand memory, timing, and multidimensional thinking.<br>🔹 <strong>Time Manipulation Mechanics</strong> – Rewind, pause, and desync dimensions to escape traps, unlock secrets, and break temporal logic.<br>🔹 <strong>A Deepening Mystery</strong> – Discover the truth behind PROJECTA, the interdimensional experiment gone wrong, and face the consequences of fragmented existence.<br>🔹 <strong>Stylized Visuals and Dynamic Environments</strong> – A unique blend of retro-futuristic design and abstract architecture that evolves as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether played solo or with a friend, <i>PROJECTA</i> delivers an intense blend of cerebral gameplay and emotional storytelling. The line between you and your other self is thin and time is running out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras/0534f4b2813a19e845af2cc144d7d31d.avif?t=1779993409\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras_big/0534f4b2813a19e845af2cc144d7d31d.avif?t=1779993409 width=800 height=282 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras/53fa3275b60c625918adb306c90e582c.avif?t=1779993409\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras_big/53fa3275b60c625918adb306c90e582c.avif?t=1779993409 width=800 height=159 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras/71f0c04877c518bf354c72bb776a713c.poster.avif?t=1779993409\" width=750 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras/71f0c04877c518bf354c72bb776a713c.webm?t=1779993409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras/71f0c04877c518bf354c72bb776a713c.mp4?t=1779993409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧠 <strong>PROJECTA – Step Into the Rift Between Realities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>PROJECTA</i>, a co-op narrative-driven puzzle-action adventure that thrusts you and your alternate self into a collapsing multiverse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where parallel timelines are fraying, you and your variant must collaborate to restore stability — or risk becoming echoes of forgotten possibilities. Swap realities, manipulate time, and solve mind-bending spatial challenges as you traverse an ever-shifting world shaped by your choices and your coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras/16fa61f8d1fcc50d5f68d12156f82df3.poster.avif?t=1779993409\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras/16fa61f8d1fcc50d5f68d12156f82df3.webm?t=1779993409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras/16fa61f8d1fcc50d5f68d12156f82df3.mp4?t=1779993409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌌 Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 <strong>Doppelgänger Co-Op Gameplay</strong> – Control or cooperate with your alternate self across split timelines. Work together, or reverse time to undo critical mistakes.<br>🔹 <strong>Reality-Shifting Puzzles</strong> – Navigate rooms that change form between timelines. Solve puzzles that demand memory, timing, and multidimensional thinking.<br>🔹 <strong>Time Manipulation Mechanics</strong> – Rewind, pause, and desync dimensions to escape traps, unlock secrets, and break temporal logic.<br>🔹 <strong>A Deepening Mystery</strong> – Discover the truth behind PROJECTA, the interdimensional experiment gone wrong, and face the consequences of fragmented existence.<br>🔹 <strong>Stylized Visuals and Dynamic Environments</strong> – A unique blend of retro-futuristic design and abstract architecture that evolves as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether played solo or with a friend, <i>PROJECTA</i> delivers an intense blend of cerebral gameplay and emotional storytelling. The line between you and your other self is thin and time is running out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras/0534f4b2813a19e845af2cc144d7d31d.avif?t=1779993409\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras_big/0534f4b2813a19e845af2cc144d7d31d.avif?t=1779993409 width=800 height=282 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras/53fa3275b60c625918adb306c90e582c.avif?t=1779993409\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras_big/53fa3275b60c625918adb306c90e582c.avif?t=1779993409 width=800 height=159 /></span></p>", "short_description